          "quote": "This guide supports sufficient interpreted context under [Foundations](FOUNDATIONS.md) and the shared [transformation library](TRANSFORMATION_LIBRARY.md). Clear writing preserves the governing layer and material determinations; shortening prose alone establishes no semantic or operational improvement.",
