      "key": "paired_evidence_requirement",
      "statement": "Collect attribute-ledger evidence in multiple candidate contexts with at least one structurally similar null peer lacking the candidate's identity content in those same contexts. Pair candidate/context and null/context entries to separate identity from context signal. Entries remain distributed raw material, not the object.",
