      "key": "overlay_publication_surfaces",
      "statement": "Expose at least versioned representation space/attribute basis, geometric direction, core+coat evidence traced to ledger entries, verification treatments/outcomes/held-out contexts, identity-preserving projection support, null peers tested and accepted/rejected results, and applicable instance α. Direction revision creates a superseding overlay. Representation-space change supersedes every affected direction even without ledger changes; prior overlays are never mutated in place.",
