      "statement": "Store an entity-cut-attached package, not merely a table row or membership list: representation/version; direction/support; distributed ledger pointers; treatment/context/outcome trace; accepting party and assurance basis; and predecessor overlay, if any. Losing any surface makes the layout unlawful. Derived query planes/projections do not substitute.",
