      "statement": "All projections should remain traceable to governing objects, evidence, treatments, covariance edges, adjoints and applicable temporal references. Reliance for a declared source-to-consumer claim applies Faithful projection with the kernel as source and binds material relations, exact selectors and required declared loss. Publication alone proves neither fidelity nor new authority. Tables, schemas, APIs, mapping documents and covariant transforms are forms over the kernel; prefer world model → API contract → schema contract. Query/traversal delivery importance does not transfer kernel ownership.",
      "uncertainty": "The referenced Faithful projection contract is not supplied."
